{
  "notes": {
    "status": "All values are synthetic assumptions, not verified maritime schedules or operational statistics.",
    "ports": "Port names are labels only.",
    "units": "Durations in hours unless suffixed otherwise; timestamps stored and computed in UTC.",
    "checkpoint": "T1 = actual destination-port arrival. Upstream timestamps are built backwards from T1.",
    "customs_calendar": "Synthetic rule: customs processing may only start Mon-Fri at or after 08:00 destination-local time; public holidays are ignored.",
    "truck_slot": "planned_truck_slot = P3 (planned customs release). Lateness L = T3 - P3 is measured against this appointment.",
    "truck_slot_availability": "Congestion-dependent stochastic truck-slot availability (synthetic approximation). Pickup windows of slot_window_h hours start at P3; window 0 is the booked window. If L < window, wait = 0. Otherwise j = floor(L / window); N consecutive windows starting with window j are unavailable, with q = clip(q_max - kappa * congestion_dwell, q_min, q_max) and N = min(N_max, floor(ln u / ln(1 - q))), u ~ U(0,1]. N = 0 gives wait 0, otherwise wait = (j + N) * window - L. After N_max skipped windows the next window is treated as available, so wait <= N_max * window. Availability is sampled independently per shipment: there is no shared capacity or competition between shipments.",
    "truck_slot_expected_wait": "Capped geometric: E[N] = sum_{k=1..N_max} (1-q)^k. At L = window, E[wait] = window * E[N]. Theoretical E[wait] at L = window: q=0.90 -> 0.67h, q=0.72 -> 2.33h, q=0.54 -> 5.10h,q=0.36 -> 10.37h, q=0.30 -> 13.19h. These are properties of the mechanism, not dataset targets.",
    "truck_slot_change_log": "Replaces an earlier fixed rebooking jump of U(12,36)*(1+congestion) whenever L > 6h, which produced a structural gap in final delay. The new mechanism is not tuned to any model metric or delay distribution.",
    "early_pickup": "Cargo ready before its planned truck slot may be collected early (deliberate simplification).",
    "seasonality": "Only destination congestion and destination weather are seasonal, keyed to T1's destination-local month.",
    "missingness": "MCAR, applied after ground truth. Masked actual departures leave P0, P1, T1 and arrival_delay_h observable."
  },
